## Romanian Tax Rules (static context)
- All gains/dividends → declare in *Declarația Unică* even if broker withholds.
- Capital gains tax: **3%** if position held >365 days; **6%** if ≤365 days.
- Foreign broker (no Romanian office) → user must self-withhold & pay. Not applicable here.

